POST {{baseUrl}}/learning/quiz/2/submit
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{user1_token}}

{
  "quiz_id": 2,
  "reponses": [
    { "question_id": 3, "reponses_multiple": [1,3] },
    { "question_id": 4, "reponse_vrai_faux": false }
  ],
  "temps_total_secondes": 85
}

###

### 16b. (Reprise Final) Soumettre une première tentative du quiz final (>=80%)
POST {{baseUrl}}/learning/quiz/3/submit
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{user1_token}}

{
  "quiz_id": 3,
  "reponses": [
    { "question_id": 5, "reponse_vrai_faux": true },
    { "question_id": 6, "reponse_texte": "mfa" }
  ],
  "temps_total_secondes": 120
}

###

### 16c. (Reprise Final) Soumettre une tentative avec score inférieur (score non mis à jour)
